      "title": "Esha Media Research Ltd. Announces Board Changes, Effective February 13, 2026",
      "body": "Esha Media Research Ltd. held a meeting of the Board of Directors on February 13, 2026. The Board of Directors took note of resignation of Mr. Shishir Dileep Joshi as an Independent Director of the Company with effect from February 13, 2026. The Board of Directors approved appointment of Ms. Dimple Joshi (DIN: 10418431) as an Additional Independent Director of the Company based on the recommendation of Nomination and Remuneration Committee with effect from February 13, 2026. The Board of Directors reviewed and discussed Internal Audit Report for the quarter ended December 31, 2025 along with the Management Response and observations of the Audit Committee.",
